Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.48,0:00:04.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.48,0:00:04.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.67,0:00:06.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Aren't you excited we're going on our honeymoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.67,0:00:06.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们就要去度蜜月了  你期待吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.48,0:00:07.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.48,0:00:07.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.49,0:00:10.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bermuda, Bahama, come on pretty mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.49,0:00:10.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}百慕大  巴哈马  来吧  漂亮姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.92,0:00:13.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's right, get it out of your system while we're alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.92,0:00:13.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错  要发作就趁现在没人的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.45,0:00:16.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey. We came to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.45,0:00:16.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们是来送别的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.24,0:00:18.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Have a great honeymoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.24,0:00:18.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  祝你们蜜月玩得愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.29,0:00:20.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Thanks.  I better go pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.29,0:00:20.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢  我最好去打包行李
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:21.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I already packed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:21.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  我已经打好包了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:24.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The only thing I couldn't find, though, was your Speedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:24.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是找不到你的迷你泳裤了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Speedo? I don't have a Speedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有迷你泳裤
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:35.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna go pack my regular, long bathing suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:35.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要去打包我那条普通的超长泳裤
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.73,0:00:39.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good, you're still here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.73,0:00:39.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好  你还在
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.15,0:00:41.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wanted to tell you to have a good honeymoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.15,0:00:41.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想来祝你有个愉快的蜜月
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.37,0:00:42.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.37,0:00:42.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I also wanted you guys to know that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还要你们知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.49,0:00:46.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am telling the father today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.49,0:00:46.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天我会告诉孩子他爸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.88,0:00:53.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.88,0:00:53.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.17,0:00:56.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We know it's Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.17,0:00:56.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们知道孩子他爸是罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.78,0:00:58.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How? How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.78,0:00:58.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.44,0:01:01.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was his sweater. But, oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.44,0:01:01.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是他的毛衣  我们都又惊又喜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:04.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I so wanted Ross to know first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:04.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我好希望罗斯是第一个知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.41,0:01:06.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I am so relieved that you guys know!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.41,0:01:06.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你们知道了  我真的松了一口气
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.22,0:01:07.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That is so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.22,0:01:07.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这真的是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.55,0:01:10.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} And I'm gonna be your baby's aunt!  I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.55,0:01:10.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要当姑姑了  我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:11.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:11.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要当阿姨了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.79,0:01:14.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'm gonna be an uncle! Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.79,0:01:14.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要当叔叔了  来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.11,0:01:17.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're all gonna be aunts and uncles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.11,0:01:17.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们要当孩子的姑姑  阿姨跟叔叔了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.62,0:01:19.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, but I'm the only one related by blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.62,0:01:19.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  但只有我跟孩子有血缘关系
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.73,0:01:24.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great! So now that you all know, you can help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.73,0:01:24.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在你们知道了  你们可以帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.97,0:01:27.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Give me some advice on how to I'm gonna tell Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.97,0:01:27.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}建议我该怎么跟罗斯说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.97,0:01:28.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What were you gonna say?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.97,0:01:28.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你打算怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.98,0:01:31.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was gonna tell him that I'm gonna have the baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.98,0:01:31.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要告诉他我想留下孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.39,0:01:33.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and he can be as involved as he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.39,0:01:33.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他想怎么做都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.85,0:01:35.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.85,0:01:35.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听起来很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.59,0:01:37.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, but, you know, how do I start?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.59,0:01:37.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  但我该怎么开口呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.67,0:01:39.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, what's the first thing that I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.67,0:01:39.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说我的开场白应该是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.74,0:01:45.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, great. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.74,0:01:45.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  太棒了  谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.05,0:01:48.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Hey, good luck.  Yeah, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.05,0:01:48.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}祝你好运   再见
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.18,0:01:51.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, what was that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.18,0:01:51.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}刚才是怎么一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.39,0:01:53.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I guess there's no harm in telling you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.39,0:01:53.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看来现在告诉你也没关系了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.97,0:01:56.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rachel and Ross are going to have a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.97,0:01:56.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋怀了罗斯的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.31,0:01:57.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.31,0:01:57.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.78,0:02:01.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't even know that...!Why didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.78,0:02:01.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我完全不知道  你为什么不告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.64,0:02:04.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why am I talking like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.64,0:02:04.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我为什么会这用这种声音说话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.65,0:02:08.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't think you could keep it a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.65,0:02:08.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得你藏不住秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.53,0:02:09.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.53,0:02:09.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.66,0:02:12.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am an excellent secretkeeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.66,0:02:12.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的嘴可严了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.10,0:02:14.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have kept all our secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.10,0:02:14.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一直保守着我们所有的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.54,0:02:17.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} What secrets?  No, no, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.54,0:02:17.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么秘密  不  乔伊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.03,0:02:20.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not gonna tell you, because I am an excellent secretkeeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.03,0:02:20.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会告诉你  因为我的嘴很严
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.62,0:02:26.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} You'll tell me later?  You already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.62,0:02:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}待会你会告诉我  你已经知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.68,0:02:34.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends S08E03 The One Where Rachel Tells…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.68,0:02:34.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》  第八季  第3集  瑞秋告诉了罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.76,0:03:13.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's so romantic to send people off on their honeymoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.76,0:03:13.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}送别人去度蜜月  真的好浪漫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:17.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, Monica and Chandler are married.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:17.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡跟钱德勒结婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.00,0:03:19.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross and Rachel are having a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.00,0:03:19.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯跟瑞秋就要生宝宝了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.29,0:03:20.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe you and I should do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.29,0:03:20.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许你跟我也该找些事来做
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.89,0:03:24.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All in good time, my love. All in good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.89,0:03:24.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别急  吾爱  等到合适的时机吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.68,0:03:29.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shoot! I left my guitar in their apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.68,0:03:29.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}该死  我把吉他放在他们家了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.88,0:03:31.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you can let me in later, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.88,0:03:31.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你待会能帮我开门吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:32.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I don't have a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:32.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行  我没有钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.67,0:03:34.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They took mine to give to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.67,0:03:34.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们拿走我的钥匙说是要交给你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:36.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? They took mine to give to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:36.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  他们拿走我的说是要交给你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.82,0:03:39.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would they take away our keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.82,0:03:39.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们为什么要拿走我们的钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.37,0:03:40.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe they don't trust us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.37,0:03:40.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许他们不信任我们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.83,0:03:42.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's not it. They let me keep my key
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.83,0:03:42.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不对啊  他们上次出城时
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.44,0:03:44.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}the last time they were out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.44,0:03:44.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还让我帮他们保管钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.02,0:03:45.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You mean the time you broke the ketchup bottle
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.02,0:03:45.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那次你打破番茄酱瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.83,0:03:48.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and cleaned it with Monica's guest towels?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.83,0:03:48.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拿莫妮卡给客人准备的毛巾来清理
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.34,0:03:51.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Hey, I washed those.  No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.34,0:03:51.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我洗了毛巾  才没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.15,0:03:54.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, that didn't sound like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.15,0:03:54.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  那听起来不像我的作风
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.70,0:03:58.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What am I gonna do? I really need my guitar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.70,0:03:58.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该怎么办  我真的要用吉他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:04:00.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have stuff in there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:04:00.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也有东西放在他们家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.03,0:04:02.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} What stuff?  Monica's chicken parm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.03,0:04:02.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么东西  莫妮卡的奶酪鸡排
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.36,0:04:03.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.36,0:04:03.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我来想办法解决
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.34,0:04:08.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Mr. Treeger? It's Joey Tribbiani.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.34,0:04:08.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}崔格先生  我是乔伊·崔比安尼
