Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.97,0:04:23.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Did Rachel find you?  No, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.97,0:04:23.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋找到你了吗  没有  怎么了
