Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.94,0:04:34.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  似乎是有重要的事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.12,0:04:38.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.12,0:04:38.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.86,0:04:40.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
