Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:52.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We promised we weren't gonna tell anybody this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:52.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们答应不会告诉任何人  但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.97,0:04:57.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}About a month ago, Rachel and I slept together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.97,0:04:57.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大约一个月前瑞秋跟我上床了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.50,0:04:59.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.50,0:04:59.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结果呢
