Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.78,0:05:06.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为你们会大吃一惊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.50,0:05:09.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, sorry. And?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.50,0:05:09.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉  结果呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.91,0:05:17.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, we said we'd just do it that one time...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.91,0:05:17.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们说只做一次...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.59,0:05:22.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but now I think she may wanna start things up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.59,0:05:22.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想她现在或许想要跟我复合
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.39,0:05:25.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I don't think that's what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.39,0:05:25.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想不是那样的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.27,0:05:28.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why? What else could it be?
