Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.18,0:05:36.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得就是那么一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.35,0:05:39.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No wonder she was looking at me all funny during the wedding.
