Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.41,0:05:43.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She didn't say anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.41,0:05:43.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她什么都没有告诉你们吗
