Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.47,0:18:45.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不吃快一点的话就没得吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.87,0:18:50.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Am I interrupting?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.87,0:18:50.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我打扰你们了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.93,0:18:52.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, Dr. Long. Please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.93,0:18:52.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  朗格医生  请进
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.54,0:18:54.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is Ross. He is the father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.54,0:18:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是罗斯  孩子的爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.88,0:18:58.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But not the husband, because, evidently, she can do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.88,0:18:58.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我不是她的丈夫  因为显然她能单独带大孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.14,0:19:02.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nice to meet you. I'll get started on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.14,0:19:02.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很高兴能见到你  我要开始检查了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.11,0:19:06.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know why you can't admit you need me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.11,0:19:06.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么不能承认你需要我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.91,0:19:09.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I do need you. I need you to stay near my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.91,0:19:09.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的确需要你  我需要你站在床头这边
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.81,0:19:15.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Everything looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.81,0:19:15.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  看起来很正常
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.75,0:19:17.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here it is on the screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.75,0:19:17.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}银幕上的画面是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.52,0:19:19.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's your uterus...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.52,0:19:19.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是你的子宫...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.41,0:19:24.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and right here is your baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.41,0:19:24.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}宝宝在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.97,0:19:27.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.97,0:19:27.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.10,0:19:34.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There it is. I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.10,0:19:34.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它在那里  我看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.62,0:19:38.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Congratulations. I'll give you two a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.62,0:19:38.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恭喜  我让你们独处一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.19,0:19:40.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Okay.  Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.19,0:19:40.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.95,0:19:49.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pretty amazing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.95,0:19:49.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很神奇吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.46,0:19:52.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.46,0:19:52.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.82,0:20:04.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} What? What?  I can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.82,0:20:04.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  我看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.29,0:20:07.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you just said that you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.29,0:20:07.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你说你看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.62,0:20:09.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know. I lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.62,0:20:09.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道  我说谎了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.01,0:20:11.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't want her to think I was a terrible mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.01,0:20:11.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不希望她认为我是个很糟糕的母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.03,0:20:13.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't even see my own baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.03,0:20:13.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我连自己的宝宝都看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.42,0:20:15.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, sure. Come here. Sure, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.42,0:20:15.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}过来  你可以看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.61,0:20:19.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come here. Look, it's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.61,0:20:19.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}过来  就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.78,0:20:26.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, it's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.78,0:20:26.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.91,0:20:29.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I see it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.91,0:20:29.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.57,0:20:34.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Do you really?  No, I don't see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.57,0:20:34.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗  不  我看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.95,0:20:37.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Come on. All right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.95,0:20:37.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.03,0:20:43.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You see this tiny thing that looks like a peanut?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.03,0:20:43.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看到那个像花生一样的小东西了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.13,0:20:45.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.13,0:20:45.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:47.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sweetie, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:47.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的  就是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:49.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:49.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.76,0:20:52.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I saw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.76,0:20:52.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:21:00.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Thank you.  You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:21:00.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢  别客气
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.78,0:21:08.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, I can't believe that's our baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.78,0:21:08.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不敢相信那是我们的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.93,0:21:14.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, that's our baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.93,0:21:14.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  那是我们的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.89,0:21:27.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So how was the doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.89,0:21:27.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}医生怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.82,0:21:29.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everything went great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.82,0:21:29.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一切都很顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.51,0:21:32.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Good.  Hey, show them the picture of your uterus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.51,0:21:32.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好  让他们看看你子宫的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.04,0:21:40.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't see the baby. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.04,0:21:40.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看不到宝宝  它在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.60,0:21:42.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, I know. I couldn't see it either at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.60,0:21:42.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道  刚开始我也看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.62,0:21:44.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But it's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.62,0:21:44.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但它就在...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.16,0:21:48.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, I lost it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.16,0:21:48.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  我又看不到了
